#30225
ganon~
Ganon~
The All-Mighty Ganon stands here in the shadows.
~
Ganon stands here, dressed only in a black robe, holding a staff which he
twirls through the air.  He resembles a pig in several ways, although he is
quite large.  His shadowy body yields when struck, but every mortal wound
begins to close around a cold glint of silver.  Before you can make sense of
the omen, he attacks!
~
pig~
