#30345
hyrule money game elder gambler gambling old man~
a gambling old man~
An old man waits behind three concealed rupee signs.
~
He offers the same risky money-making game found across the
First Quest: three signs, one choice, and no way to tell them
apart.

Type GAMBLE to play.  Each go costs 10 rupees, and the sign you
pick either pays you 50 or 20 rupees, or takes another 20 or 40
off you.  All four outcomes are equally likely, so the house edge
is real and patience is not a strategy.
~
