#30200
The First Quest Begins~
A small green field lies at the foot of rocky brown hills, quiet and sunny,
the grass trampled into a faint path. In the cliff face to the north a dark
cave mouth opens, and from within flickers the warm glow of twin fires. The
wider world is no place to wander alone and empty-handed. Paths lead north,
east and west.
