#30204
Path to the Manji~
A narrow trail winds east through the woods toward a ring of trees that
grow in an oddly regular pattern, too neat to be natural. The birdsong
fades and the air grows cooler and quieter the farther east the path goes.
Other trails branch away north and west into the deeper forest.
