#30205
Grove of the Manji~
A ring of tall trees encloses a hushed clearing, and at its center a dark
stone entrance is carved in the shape of a turning, four-armed cross. Cold
air breathes out of the doorway, smelling of moss, damp stone and something
older. Rocks wall in the clearing on the south and east, and the only way
out is west.
