#30206
Sandy Glade~
A clearing of loose, pale sand opens among the trees, oddly bare where the
forest should be. The sand is rippled and pocked with small round burrow
holes, and every so often it seems to stir on its own. Overhead something
whirrs and spins in the air. Paths lead north into the woods and east
toward the hills.
