#30207
Crags West of the Start~
Brown rock juts up in jagged ridges just west of a quiet green field, the
ground between them dented where long-legged things have landed hard. One
rock face looks cracked and weak, as if a good blast might open a way into
it. Paths lead north, east toward the hills, and west into the woods.
