#30208
Meadow East of the Cave~
Open grassland stretches east from the starting hills, dotted with small
boulders and clumps of bushes. Pebbles lie strewn across the grass as
though spat from somewhere. One bush beside the rocks is dry and brittle,
its leaves curling brown, plainly ready to burn. Paths lead north, east and
west.
