Stone Field~
A field of jumbled grey and brown boulders sprawls across the southern edge
of the land, the grass growing in tufts between them. One great stone sits
loose in its bed, with fresh-turned earth around its base, as if a strong
enough arm could shift it aside. The field opens east and west.
