Rocky Southern Ridge~
A rocky ridge runs along the southern edge of the land, brown stone
breaking through thin, wind-flattened grass. The ground is scuffed with odd
paired footprints that appear and vanish again several paces on, as if
whatever made them leapt. Trails follow the ridge east and west.
