#30213
Southern Shore Path~
A grassy path runs along the southern edge of the land, the low boom of the
sea drifting from the east. Beside the path rises a wall of brown rock, and
one section is cracked and crumbling, hollow-sounding when the wind moans
past it. Small stones lie scattered in the grass. Paths lead east and west.
