#30215
Southeast Coast~
The land ends at a rocky shore in the far southeastern corner of Hyrule,
where grey waves crash and white spray drifts on the wind. Gulls wheel and
cry overhead, and tide pools glimmer among the tumbled rocks. It is the
very end of the world in two directions. Paths lead north along the coast
and west inland.
