#30220
The Lost Woods~
Every trunk here looks like every other, and the paths twist so strangely
that a traveller can walk out one side of the grove and find the same trees
waiting. A low rise above the trail holds the dark mouth of a cave, and a
bitter smell of simmering herbs drifts from it. Near the path a lone bush
stands dry and dead, brittle enough to catch from a single spark.
