Forest Stream~
A narrow stream threads through the trees, chattering over pebbles and
pooling in quiet, fern-hung basins. Mossy stepping stones make for an easy
crossing, though now and then the water swirls and bulges with no wind to
stir it. Cool air rises off the current, and paths lead away in all four
directions.
