#30673
It's a Secret to Everybody~
This cave sits in plain sight on the eastern shore, which may be why nobody
bothers to look in it. Two fires burn on either side of the floor, warming
a chamber that smells of salt and seaweed. The secret of the place is not
where it is, but how much it gives away.
~
