#30674
Under the Armos Statue~
The statue that guarded this spot has been moved, and beneath it lies a
shallow stone alcove cut square into the bedrock. Its walls bear faded
carvings of a hand gripping a mountain. The space is just large enough to
kneel in, and it was clearly made to keep one small thing safe.
~
