#30680
A Merchant's Cave~
Two fires light a dry, low-ceilinged cave where three wares are laid out in
a neat row on the bare floor. A painted price is set beneath each one in
rupees, and there is no haggling. The merchant has chosen this spot
carefully: close enough to the road for trade, far enough from it for
safety.
~
