#30687
A Hidden Merchant's Cave~
This cave was hidden behind rock or root, and the merchant who trades here
prefers it that way. Two fires burn in the dim, and a short row of goods
sits on a woven mat with prices set out beneath them. The prices are kinder
than in the open caves, as a reward for finding the place.
~
