#30692
The Medicine Woman's Cave~
Bundles of dried herbs hang from the ceiling of this warm cave, and two
fires keep the damp off a row of stoppered bottles. The air smells of
bitter roots and sweet syrup. Nothing is for sale to strangers here: the
old woman who keeps the shop wants proof that the royal family sent you.
~
