#30700
The Door-Repair Charge~
A freshly mended door frame stands just inside this cave, its timbers too
new for the old rock around it. Two fires light a floor swept clean, and a
ledger lies open on a stone ledge. The owner believes firmly that whoever
opened the way should pay for the damage, and keeps a careful account.
~
