#30710
A Money-Making Game~
Three overturned signs lie on the floor of this cave, each hiding a sum
painted on its underside. Two fires throw their light across them evenly,
so nothing gives away which is which. The game is honest, in its way:
anybody can play, and anybody can lose.
~
