#30720
The Warp Stairway Hall~
Beneath the moved stone a short stair descends into a long, bare hall cut
from the bedrock. Three dark stairways open in its far wall, each worn
smooth by long use and each leading a very long way under the land. A
carving over them reads, in old letters, take any road you want.
~
